#   6:31-13:20   beta 16 Hz hold
#   13:20-16:54  smooth slide 16 Hz -> 10 Hz
#   16:54-30:00  alpha ~10 Hz hold (delivery trims to the narration length)
#
# 200 Hz carrier binaural beats with a soft pink-noise bed. Binaural tones
# require headphones. None of OCF's promises are psychoacoustic; this is a
# low-level tonal bed under narration.
